# Acceptance bar

Reject the draft (do not mark ready) if any apply:

- Proof language: show that / prove / verify that
- Multiple asks, parts (a)(b), or more than one independent question mark pair
- Guessable: MC, T/F, yes/no
- Answer is DNE
- Missing answer-format sentence (exact / in terms of / rounding / units)
- Missing constant, table, or convention needed to start
- Computer algebra or >calculator arithmetic
- `chemfig`, `\( \)`, `\[ \]`, `\item`, `**Step`
- Steps < 3, micro-steps, or steps nested inside steps
- Claims after clearly / note that / it follows without an argument
- Unstated assumption that would change the number
- Domain chosen for a method rather than the subject
- Concepts not in 1–5 short noun phrases
- Word puzzle, even if set-theory solvable
- Notation in the answer that was never introduced in the prompt

Error categories you must name in review notes: see `data/catalogs/error_categories.json`.

Official difficulty: ≤88% success on at least one of the two hard models. "No Response was generated by the model" is not a miss.
